Package: vacttmle
Title: Visit-Aligned Continuous-Time TMLE for Composite Time-to-Event Endpoints
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("David", "McCoy", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "david@example.com")
  )
Author: David McCoy
Maintainer: David McCoy <david@example.com>
Description: Implements a visit-aligned continuous-time targeted minimum loss
    estimator for scheduled-visit trials with a composite time-to-event endpoint.
    The current package targets composite-event-free survival, P(T^d > tau,
    D^d > tau), and the corresponding composite risk difference. Hypothetical
    no-intercurrent-event or no-switch estimands are intentionally not exposed.
